    body += '''<section class="mist-section"><div class="mist-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Warm water on a cold morning</p><h2>Comfort you notice most when the air turns blue-grey</h2><p>On frosty Orange mornings, dependable hot water is not an abstract efficiency figure. It is the warm shower, the clear glass slowly misting and the confidence that the system can recover for the household's next use.</p><p>The right recommendation balances comfort with capacity, recovery, energy source and the way the property performs through winter.</p></div><img src="/assets/steamy-blue-grey-bathroom.webp" alt="Steamy warm shower in an established Orange NSW character home on a cold blue-grey morning" width="1800" height="1024" loading="lazy"></section>'''
    body += f'''<section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">Services</p><h2>Start with the need, not the sales pitch</h2><p class="lead">Choose the situation closest to yours. Each guide explains what information helps and which decisions may follow.</p><div class="cards">{cards}</div></section>'''
